[ceiling] Functional head seat: each clamp screw's head bears on this flat. The bottom lid prints outer face down, so its Ø5.8 counterbore and radial slot open on the bed, and the seat prints as a 1.25 mm overhang ring around the screw hole, under the cold-core recipe with supports off.
alternatives: Printing mouth side down stands the plate on its head pads and turns the whole plate into a ceiling. A tree stub inside a Ø5.8 × 3.4 mm blind pocket is hard to clear and marks the bearing face. A sacrificial skin across the pocket mouth adds a drilling step.
